        "description": "Presence of dysarthria and dysphagia",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of progressive lower limb spasticity plus genetic confirmation of biallelic SPG20 mutations",
    "notes": "Clinical features combined with genetic testing are essential for definitive diagnosis."
